runtime/core/shaders/gen_post_data.py compiles six of the passes
(compute_luminance_pyramid, reconstruct_previous_depth, depth_clip, lock,
accumulate, rcas) with glslc into runtime/core/fsr2_data.h, one SPIR-V
module per combination of the options each pass reads. runtime/core/fsr2.c
ports the dispatch logic of src/ffx-fsr2-api/ffx_fsr2.cpp (resource sizes
and formats, constant buffers, the ping-pong of history resources, the
clears and the order of the passes) to the runtime's upscaler stage.

